+    # AEMULATOR: `T* const*`. Counting has to agree with reservedmarshal's WRITE pass to the byte
+    # or the encoder overruns its own reserved packet, so this mirrors that loop structure exactly:
+    # outer `len` pointers, inner `len` elements each, nothing else on the wire.
